  "description": "2027 = Updated Road Ti with 3D-printed seat tube allowing for full fender use with 35mm tires, 3D-printed bottom bracket with lower relief channel and internally flared seat stay port for easy routing, and 3D-printed rear dropouts to match the overall clean aesthetic.\n2026 = The original Road Ti with round seat tube, standard bottom bracket shell, and machined rear dropouts.\nThe Road Ti Custom Build lets you spec your own BlackHeart: an aero titanium road race bike with a fully integrated cockpit, with SRAM, Shimano or Campagnolo groupsets and your choice of wheels and cockpit. Race geometry with a pro fit gives quick, sharp handling, with clearance for 700c x 25–35mm tires. Every custom build is assembled to order in Truckee, California.\nBuild the bike of your dreams.",
